  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n18% of 450\n\n20% of 380\n\n25% of 300\n\n30% of 240\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nPercentage value = (Percentage × Total value) ÷ 100\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 18% of 450 = (18 × 450) ÷ 100\n\n⇒ 8100 ÷ 100 = 81\n\n⇒ 20% of 380 = (20 × 380) ÷ 100\n\n⇒ 7600 ÷ 100 = 76\n\n⇒ 25% of 300 = (25 × 300) ÷ 100\n\n⇒ 7500 ÷ 100 = 75\n\n⇒ 30% of 240 = (30 × 240) ÷ 100\n\n⇒ 7200 ÷ 100 = 72\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option 4.**",
